    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paws United\u00a0</strong>is a game that tells you a story about Goldie. She is a dog searching for energetic puppies that move in the same direction as her. Help Goldie move, solve puzzles by pushing boxes and obstacles, then reunite with her family! Pat their head after solving a puzzle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feature</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 levels of challenges and surprises</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pet the dogs after clearing the level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique unite and separate problem-solving mechanic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret game mode after finishing the game</p></li></ul>",
